ices, with many cases pending for mutations and registrations. Additionally, the digital crop survey is burdened by numerous unapproved surveys. Authorities have been instructed to hasten the resolution of these outstanding departmental matters. User engagement is vital to addressing cases that require citizen cooperation. Revenue officials are responsible for providing timely and transparent services to enhance citizen experience.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/technology/gurugrams-paperless-services-under-review-as-land-mutation-registration-backlogs-mount/133336663?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-71872/133336663.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "technology"}]}